                              "rawSource":  "\t\u0026Now = Now()\n\t\u0026Today = Today()\n\t\u0026Hora = \u0026Now.Hour()\n\t\n\t\u0026FechaLaboral = \u0026Today\n\tif(\u0026Hora \u003c 6)\n\t\t\u0026FechaLaboral = \u0026Today - 1\n\tendif\n\n//\tdo \u0027JornadaInicioHora\u0027\n//\tdo \u0027FechaLaboral\u0027\n//\t\n//\tSub \u0027FechaLaboral\u0027\n//\t\tif(\u0026Now.Hour() \u003e= \u0026HoraInicio.Hour())\n//\t\t\t\u0026FechaLaboral = \u0026Today\n//\t\telse\n//\t\t        \u0026FechaLaboral = \u0026Today - 1\n//\t\tendif\n//        EndSub\n//\t\n//\tSub \u0027JornadaInicioHora\u0027\n//\t\tfor each DB.Turno\n//\t\t\twhere TurnoId \u003e 0\n//\t\t\twhere TurnoEnum = EnumTurno.UNO\n//\t\t\t\u0026HoraInicio = TurnoHoraInicio\n//\t\t\tExit\n//\t\tendfor\n//\tendsub\n",
                              "cleanSource":  "\t\u0026Now = Now()\n\t\u0026Today = Today()\n\t\u0026Hora = \u0026Now.Hour()\n\t\n\t\u0026FechaLaboral = \u0026Today\n\tif(\u0026Hora \u003c 6)\n\t\t\u0026FechaLaboral = \u0026Today - 1\n\tendif\n\n//\tdo \u0027JornadaInicioHora\u0027\n//\tdo \u0027FechaLaboral\u0027\n//\t\n//\tSub \u0027FechaLaboral\u0027\n//\t\tif(\u0026Now.Hour() \u003e= \u0026HoraInicio.Hour())\n//\t\t\t\u0026FechaLaboral = \u0026Today\n//\t\telse\n//\t\t        \u0026FechaLaboral = \u0026Today - 1\n//\t\tendif\n//        EndSub\n//\t\n//\tSub \u0027JornadaInicioHora\u0027\n//\t\tfor each DB.Turno\n//\t\t\twhere TurnoId \u003e 0\n//\t\t\twhere TurnoEnum = EnumTurno.UNO\n//\t\t\t\u0026HoraInicio = TurnoHoraInicio\n//\t\t\tExit\n//\t\tendfor\n//\tendsub"
